From: well0nez <8986239+well0nez@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: arm64: dts: h713: the IOMMU comment says the codecs are translated and the display is not

0024e turned CONFIG_SUN50I_IOMMU off because nothing decoded, and its
comment above the node says so. The decoders (13.10.2026) turn it on
again, as cstenger runs them:
the VE as masters 0 and 1 (iommus from 0042), later the AV1 core as
master 5. The display stays physical - the H713 variant of the driver
(0041) starts with every master bypassing and translates only the ones
a device asks for, and no display node asks.

Comment only; the node and the VE's iommus are unchanged.
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713.dtsi
